{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Elysium Atlas — Team KB Items",
    "description": "Team knowledge library APIs (`/elysium-agents/elysium-atlas/kb-items`).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set collection variable `base_url` (default `http://localhost:7000`).\n2. Set `atlas_jwt_token` to a valid session JWT (`user_id`, `team_id`, `role`).\n3. Run create requests; `kb_id` / `file_kb_id` are auto-saved from responses when present.\n\nSee `documentation/frontend-kb-items-api-guide.md` for full API details.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{atlas_jwt_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:7000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "atlas_jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "kb_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "file_kb_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "file_key",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "URLs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create URLs (batch)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.items && json.items[0] && json.items[0].kb_id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('kb_id', json.items[0].kb_id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"urls\": [\n    \"https://example.com/docs\",\n    \"https://example.com/pricing\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/elysium-agents/elysium-atlas/kb-items/v1/create-urls",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": [
                "elysium-agents",
                "elysium-atlas",
                "kb-items",
                "v1",
                "create-urls"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Batch create URL items. One `kb_id` per URL. Indexing runs in background."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List URLs",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
